s to arrive. The keeper carefully preserved the letter, finally understanding why his mother had gazed at the horizon every dawn.", "w02": "凌晨四点的城市沉睡在深蓝色的宁静中。街灯投下柔和的光晕，照亮空荡荡的马路。偶尔有一辆出租车驶过，留下远去的尾灯。高楼大厦的窗户几乎全是黑的，只有少数几扇还闪烁着微弱的灯光，那是夜班工作者的世界。清晨的微风吹过，路边的杨树叶沙沙作响。一只野猫在暗处蜷缩，等待黎明。这个城市在这一刻属于失眠者和梦游者，属于时间的缝隙。天色未明，但黑暗正在褪去，即将迎来新的一天。", "w03": "• A function is like a set of instructions you follow step-by-step, but here's the special part: the instructions can ask you to follow the same instructions again, just with different numbers.\n• For example, if you're counting backwards from 10 to 1, you can say 'say 10, then count backwards from 9 to 1' — the second part is the same job, just smaller.\n• It keeps working until you reach the simplest case (like counting from 1 to 1), then everything unwinds and you get your answer."}
